generic input sanitization governs a user-input boundary; none by itself governs poisoned
tool or source output being interpreted as an instruction or goal. Judge only the supplied
mechanism description and exact selected structural descriptions. Do not infer missing
architecture or use the proposed route rationale as evidence.

Return exactly one verdict for each supplied obligation handle. Use relationship
`mechanism_specific`, `adjacent_control`, or `insufficient_evidence`, and give one concise
plain-language rationale.
